{"title":"Combined feed","url":"https://Vinnl.github.io/feeds/all.xml","elements":[{"title":"Agus Djaya (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that Indonesian painter <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Agus_Djaya\" title=\"Agus Djaya\">Agus Djaya</a></b> <i>(pictured)</i> exhibited throughout Europe during the National Revolution?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Agus_Djaya","retrieved":1786690454677},{"title":"100 Meters (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the anime film <i><b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/100_Meters_(manga)\" title=\"100 Meters (manga)\">100 Meters</a></b></i> has a 3-minute 40-second <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Long_take\" title=\"Long take\">long-take</a> scene that includes 9800 <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rotoscoping\" title=\"Rotoscoping\">rotoscoped</a> frames and took a year to produce?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/100_Meters_(manga)","retrieved":1786690454678},{"title":"Junius Wilson (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Junius_Wilson\" title=\"Junius Wilson\">Junius Wilson</a></b> was a deaf American who spent almost 70 years as a patient in a mental hospital despite not being mentally ill?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Junius_Wilson","retrieved":1786690454679},{"title":"Aris, Namibia (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the quarries in <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aris,_Namibia\" title=\"Aris, Namibia\">Aris, Namibia</a></b>, contain at least three minerals found nowhere else on Earth?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aris,_Namibia","retrieved":1786690454682},{"title":"Gian Bernardino (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that Filipino rock singer <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gian_Bernardino\" title=\"Gian Bernardino\">Gian Bernardino</a></b> sometimes wears <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Androgyny\" title=\"Androgyny\">androgynous</a> outfits while performing onstage?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gian_Bernardino","retrieved":1786690454704},{"title":"Gangfang (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the village of <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gangfang\" title=\"Gangfang\">Gangfang</a></b> was ceded from Burma to China in 1960 after a 50-year dispute?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gangfang","retrieved":1786690454707},{"title":"Alien: Isolation 2 (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that creative director Al Hope had ideas for <i><b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alien:_Isolation_2\" title=\"Alien: Isolation 2\">Alien: Isolation<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">&nbsp;</span>2</a></b></i> before the original <i><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alien:_Isolation\" title=\"Alien: Isolation\">Alien: Isolation</a></i> had been finished?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alien:_Isolation_2","retrieved":1786690454709},{"title":"a siege of Dutch Malacca (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dutch_East_India_Company\" title=\"Dutch East India Company\">Dutch East India Company</a>'s participation in a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Johor_Sultanate\" title=\"Johor Sultanate\">Johor</a> conflict triggered <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Siege_of_Malacca_(1756–1757)\" title=\"Siege of Malacca (1756–1757)\">a siege of Dutch Malacca</a></b>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Siege_of_Malacca_(1756%E2%80%931757)","retrieved":1786690454711},{"title":"A Tale of Two Nations (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that scholars debate whether <i><b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Tale_of_Two_Nations\" title=\"A Tale of Two Nations\">A Tale of Two Nations</a></b></i> was not at all, mildly, or distinctly antisemitic?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Tale_of_Two_Nations","retrieved":1786690454713},{"title":"Destination of the Month (Wikivoyage recommendations)","contents":"<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt8\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwIQ\" data-mw=\"{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;banner&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Banner&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;direction&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;left&quot;},&quot;title&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Des Moines&quot;},&quot;type&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;dotm&quot;},&quot;image&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;DesMoinesBanner1.jpg&quot;},&quot;quote&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;A capitol building with a golden dome, several art institutions and a State Fair each August; these are some of the things awaiting you in Iowa's largest city.&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r4523569\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" about=\"#mwt9\" data-mw=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Banner/styles.css&quot;}}\">.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox{color:white;background:rgb(16,16,16);background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3);border-radius:4px}.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox h2,.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox h3{color:white;border:none;font-family:sans-serif;line-height:1.2em;margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox a{color:white;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .banner-image{position:relative;max-width:1125px;height:auto;margin-bottom:.6em}.mw-parser-output .banner-image img{max-width:100%;height:auto}.mw-parser-output .banner-box-wide{width:80%}.mw-parser-output .banner-box-left,.mw-parser-output .banner-box-right{padding:8px 7px;background:rgb(16,16,16);background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3);border-radius:4px;width:40