.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Planning_your_flight\" title=\"Planning your flight\">Planning your flight</a></h3>\n\t\t<div class=\"quote\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Planning_your_flight\" title=\"Planning your flight\">Flight planning is usually the beginning of a long journey. There are many things to consider to make flying affordable and comfortable.</a></div>\n\t</div>\n\t<p><span class=\"nolink\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\" data-mw=\"{&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Planning your flight&quot;}\"><span title=\"Planning your flight\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/File:PlanningFlightBanner1.jpg\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikivoyage/en/8/8c/PlanningFlightBanner1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikivoyage.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Planning your flight\" data-file-width=\"1710\" data-file-height=\"570\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"567\" width=\"1700\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></span></span>\n\t<span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\" data-mw=\"{&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Planning your flight&quot;}\"><a href=\"https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Planning_your_flight\" title=\"Planning your flight\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/File:PlanningFlightBanner1.jpg\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikivoyage/en/8/8c/PlanningFlightBanner1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikivoyage.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Planning your flight\" data-file-width=\"1710\" data-file-height=\"570\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"567\" width=\"1700\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></p>\n</div>","link":"https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Previous_Featured_travel_topics","retrieved":1749318026866}]}